'''Cyber Pretty Cat''' (サイバープリティキャット, ''Saibāpuritikyatto'') is an enemy appearing in the [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Cyber Pretty Cat
|image = E 227.png
|appearance = [[Castle & Dragon Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 666円 - 2,630円
}}

==Enemy==
A somewhat difficult enemy to deal with, her moderate health makes her act like a tank but her weak attack power shouldn't be much to be scared of.  Her 255 range allows her to outrange many common [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cats]] such as [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher BearCat]] and [[Viking Cat (Rare Cat)|Maximum the Fighter]] just to name a few. Her rapid attacks make her slightly more of a threat being able to shred your defense if magnified.

==Strategy==
The best way to deal with this enemy is with a steady amount of meatshields, around 3 to 4 should work fine, and units that can outrange her such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]]. Tanky units such as [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] are able to tank her hits while also being able to deal a lot of damage.

